<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-στροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turned away, averted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστρόφους αὐγὰς ἀπείρξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					69
				</span></i>
			: <i>turned away from,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελήνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					1.57
				</span></i>
			: also c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δισσοῖς σελάεσσιν ἀ. οἶμον ἰοῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.127
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Ost.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>not conjoined,</i> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				53.24
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be turned from, dreadful,</i> epith. of the Erinyes, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				70.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-στροφος</span></b> , ἡ,
				<i>apostrophe,</i> Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.135H.
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>mark of elision,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				638.19
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>turning away</i> of chorus from stage in Comic parabasis, <i><span class="en">
				Platon.
				<u>Diff.Com.</u>
				8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
